  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e4d10d53cbc5ad2e",
      "translationZh": "添加 maxEffortLevel 设置（顶级或在 modelSettings 下的每个模型）：对每个提供者（包括 Bedrock、Vertex 和 Foundry）限制努力级别；用户仍可选择较低级别。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad62d970f5ce1a36",
      "translationZh": "添加 --system-prompt-snapshot off，以在每个请求上重新渲染系统提示，而不是重用对话中记录的提示（用于迭代提示文本）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a1d0d56da5e2cfc",
      "translationZh": "修复了云端 Cowork 计划任务在启动时失败的问题，适用于其托管设置要求沙盒化的组织。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5abf9feb5465b547",
      "translationZh": "修复了 /context 及其他本地命令输出在移动客户端上呈现为空白的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a192d7794166cbe",
      "translationZh": "修复了在代理视图中重新连接到 tmux 或 ssh 会话后，shift+enter 和 option+backspace 不起作用的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5675d40e73168696",
      "translationZh": "修复了在全屏模式下向上滚动时，淡化的最后提示标题未出现在对话顶部的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb9b44927a937f62",
      "translationZh": "修复了 Workflow agent() 调用在 auto mode 下因输出 schema 过大而被拒绝，而不是由安全分类器进行检查的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59d6a284d5d37bd0",
      "translationZh": "修复了市场条目路径中包含反斜杠时，在 macOS 和 Linux 上获取的市场可能绕过 containment 检查的情况。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "494954998d0e2a59",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 Claude Desktop 等宿主应用中，AWS 或 Google Cloud 凭据过期后，重试十次出现通用 \"request failed\" 才显示重新认证错误的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ff195638f536fea",
      "translationZh": "修复了在使用 -p --resume 执行 /compact 或其他斜杠命令后恢复会话时，不再插入多余的 \"Continue from where you left off.\" 回合。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b1ba9ddf2e60b93",
      "translationZh": "修复了恢复大型会话（转录超过 5 MB）时，重新加载的对话不会再丢失并行工具调用及其钩子输出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24eea86d3d184996",
      "translationZh": "修复了在不可读时，托管的 allowedHttpHookUrls、httpHookAllowedEnvVars 和 allowedChannelPlugins 现在只允许 nothing（无内容），而不再允许 everything（全部内容）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b4397e2dfa62e630",
      "translationZh": "修复了在需要 Claude 应用网关登录的托管设置机器上，/login 时 Esc 键现在会关闭对话框，而不是无响应。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "777b70656a3a4fb8",
      "translationZh": "修复了因上传过程中连接中断导致的制品发布被截断的问题：现在当 Claude Code 能检测到上传未完成时，会重试一次，而不是报告未知结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "73958845c10d9e36",
      "translationZh": "修复了在默认 effort 仍被固定的模型（Opus 4.7、Opus 4.8、Fable 5）上，自定义命令、技能和子代理的 frontmatter 被忽略的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0cbe2a0db3d1624e",
      "translationZh": "修复了当页面文件不是有效的 UTF-8 或包含替换字符（U+FFFD）时，制品发布因未 helpful 错误而失败的问题：现在错误会指出需要修复的行号和列号。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "98764fa87ba2522d",
      "translationZh": "修复了 claude 代理在目录菜单中不列出会话开始后创建的仓库的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "66f2f1a6978dde2d",
      "translationZh": "修复了加入 Claude Desktop 或 VS Code 会话的 Remote Control 客户端在权限模式变更前显示过时权限模式的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "790670443d842a10",
      "translationZh": "修复了 claude remote-control 在其服务器凭据过期（大约启动后 30 天）时退出并断开所有附加会话的问题；现在主机会重新注册并继续运行",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed5da95f4baa7455",
      "translationZh": "修复了在会话期间，当不同模型或模式的请求报告不同限制窗口时，使用限制警告会闪烁的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "113504ec45f97120",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 MCP 服务器重新发送或内置工具重新渲染模型已加载的工具时，之前的推理被丢弃的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ac6f91a690ed52f",
      "translationZh": "修复了在对话中途因 MCP 服务器断开连接或升级而导致的工具消失问题，这会重写工具列表并丢弃之前的思考",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "293fc3bea0f7a003",
      "translationZh": "修复了从对话派生的后台工作进程在会话中途将 EnterWorktree 添加到对话的工具块，从而破坏了 prompt-cache 复用的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "928966812bf3de3f",
      "translationZh": "修复了在没有 ToolSearch 的会话中，中期 MCP 和插件工具被添加到工具列表，从而破坏了 prompt-cache 复用的问题；受支持的模型现在将它们作为延迟定义接收",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc9eded2eaa80a52",
      "translationZh": "修复了在切换模型时 /model 重新发送每个工具定义（导致 prompt-cache 未命中）；提交和 PR 归属文本现在作为对话注释到达，并在模型变更时更新。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
